o the northeast; Switzerland to the east; Italy and Monaco to the southeast; Andorra and Spain to the south; and a maritime border with the United Kingdom to the northwest. Its metropolitan area extends from the Rhine to the Atlantic Ocean and from the Mediterranean Sea to the English Channel and the North Sea. Its 18 integral regions—five of which are overseas—span a combined area of 632,702 km2 (244,288 sq mi), with a total population estimated at over 69.1 million in 2026. Its capital, largest city and main…","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/France","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"FR"}],"arc":{"reports":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-13T04:34:48Z","first_title":"Cyberattack Hijacks French Grocery Fridges, Echoing U.S. Military Base Outages","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOX0d4Y3NzYTdGVjRfN0Nqc1J1d0tsU1hPMWstRS1qZGV5eVpsVWZ0NzdoUjNKOFVteVJzYVY0dW1vS21zc21RMVlSZU9MUjlBMUM0a1gxS0FZbXJ3UzRpN0NjSzNfc3I2aS01UmhTbkQxQ2U1U1pMNFNaMURibHdIenVuM0lobmxrcUVwTXhZc0lkX3U1OFBCaDhIVzBFVDg?oc=5","first_publisher":"The SOFX Report","earlier":[{"id":"e_d73d31d911ec","title":"Pentagon hit with class action over data breach affecting millions of military members","date":"2026-10-21T16:32:36Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOOGZMZ3YzV2F0WmE0eUdxQkZnS24taEt0LW1KeG9wdVB4LUFha2F2SFJ6NmZvcUdNcEdZTUxZTkRLaUxqMnYtNmJQN0NQc09IYU5DbGtkbW9SRFhCUEpIbVh0VjBRTXR2dnhvOTdOdldzYWUyX3ltTTMzdmxUenFXNXpWa1FhOW9yQ3NqZVJ2cnA5QVJkN1FrbFZwQ0p2alpUdGQtN0hrOUNCTkVFR2dscWdXd1ZTSWVSWWh5RjRRQUE5SkhhSTc0?oc=5","publisher":"Reuters","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_b29a1a9f27e9","title":"Freezers At U.S. Military Bases Kept Malfunctioning. Officials Believe It Could Have Been a Cyberattack","date":"2026-10-29T15:42:01Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPS3IzVEhtcFl5SHZkU1dJbGVmNUlMQnptVENRd2FuNGs4Nlc4aW9GejRERTRhMThvRFptdm5FbjAwUTdQV055Rm9jTGU3ckNfZkVPcTR2bm9OUWJvTlpfTTBWUXgzck1LR3Fxby1EVjAxSlZ